<div class="resources">
    <h3>Reference Docs</h3>
    <p>Need a deeper explanation? These pages cover the same concepts:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="../docs/unit-01/index.html">Unit 1: Setup &amp; Movement</a> — input, vectors, and translation in depth</li>
        <li><a href="../docs/reference/unity-csharp-quickref.html">Unity + C# Quick Reference</a> — input and vector functions</li>
        <li><a href="../docs/ask.html">How do I…? index</a> — find this lesson again by the question you were asking</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Next: <a href="1.5.html">1.5 — Movement II: Speed, deltaTime &amp; Tuning</a>, where you compare four ways to move an object and pick the one this game needs.</p>
</div>`;
